Setting Where Registry <code>--registry</code>, else <code>$HIVE_REGISTRY</code>, else <code>~/.hive/config.json</code>, else <code>https://packages.beelang.dev</code> Hive home <code>$HIVE_HOME</code>, default <code>~/.hive</code> - holds <code>lib/</code>, <code>cache/</code>, <code>config.json</code> Extra module roots for <code>bee</code> <code>$BEE_PATH</code> <pre><code>// ~/.hive/config.json
{ "registry": "https://packages.example.com" }
</code></pre> <p>Downloads are cached in <code>$HIVE_HOME/cache</code>, keyed by content hash - so a cache hit verifies itself, and two packages shipping identical bytes share one entry.</p>

Function Description <code>exec(cmd)</code> Run <code>cmd</code> in the shell; returns <code>{"code": exit_status, "output": stdout}</code>. <pre><code>let r = exec("ls -1")
if r.code == 0 {
    for line in r.output.trim().split("\n") { print(line) }
}
</code></pre>
